    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present this stunning 3-bedroom 3-bathroom home, No. 7 The Place, Citywest Village. Modelled on the red brick Edwardian Street scapes of some of Dublin's oldest villages, Citywest Village is tastefully designed to a very high standard. Flooded with natural light, the living spaces are bright and airy with a warm feeling throughout. This property will be sure to attract all keen first and second time buyers alike given the convenient location and the array of nearby amenities and services. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway, downstairs w/c, large living room, spacious kitchen / dining area and a 2nd reception room overlooking the garden. While upstairs there are 3 large bedrooms one with en suite together with a contemporary designed family bathroom. An enclosed spacious rear garden which has been tastefully designed provides an ideal setting for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. The high spec open plan kitchen, large room proportions, landscaped garden and proximity to public transport to the front are core areas of this wonderful property encompassing a beautiful aesthetically pleasing finish in an open plan setting.\n\nThe property is conveniently positioned within the Citywest Village development. Citywest Village is a highly sought after development situated in an ideal location offering a scenic backdrop to the Dublin mountains while at the same time providing ease of access to Dublin's city centre. The property is located in a prime location in Citywest just off the Old Naas Road while at the same time only 10km's from Dublins city centre. The property is within walking distance of Citywest business campus, Citywest Shopping Centre, Citywest hotel, two golf courses, shops, sports and leisure facilities. Tallaght Village and The Square shopping centre are also close by. A new primary school Scoil Aoife has also opened very recently close by. There is ease of access to the M50 road network and public transport is well catered for with numerous Dublin Bus services travelling to the city centre with the number 69 stop a short walk away. There is ease of access to all major road networks namely to include the M50, N81 and N7. Citywest is also serviced by the Luas red line which is on your doorstep.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPlease see 3D Tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=jCEhYRq5UqN\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Stunning (A) rated Edwardian styled red brick property</li><li> 3 bedroom property in turn key condition throughout</li><li> 3 bathrooms including master en-suite</li><li> Open plan high spec kitchen design</li><li> Heat pump fired central heating</li><li> High quality flooring throughout</li><li> Ideally loacted in the development, close to large green</li><li> Quiet cul de sac</li><li> Parking to front of the property</li><li> Highly sought after location</li><li> Luas on your doorstep</ul>"
      },
